# Pin for the vendored golden vectors (golden-vectors/protocol-vectors.json).
# tag    = the infinassistant-firmware tag whose infinassistant/vectors/protocol-vectors.json the copy equals.
# sha256 = the SHA-256 of that file, which is also the SHA-256 of the copy.
# CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) fetches the file at the tag and byte-compares it with the copy.
# To update: copy the file from the new tag, then change both values below.
